		{
			dependencies: [
				"7B195200D9D3485B"
			]
			description: [
				"A cut leaves as hot as its section. Carbolic oil, creosote and vinegar come out hot, and no PVC pipe carries them; pitch is always kept warm. A Steel Condenser anywhere but beside a column cools hot cuts inline."
				""
				"Whatever escapes over the top hangs low as solvent vapour, and flashes into flame at anything &eWarm&r or hotter."
				""
				"&7JEI: the Cooling Hot Cuts tab.&r"
